ou scheme your way to an ending. Meet new coworkers, try new scenarios, and discover a new fate for SCOUT. Maybe this time you will take over the world and destroy all humans!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146390/extras/24c371eb60d6ba2cc7b2567b3fab2128.poster.avif?t=1753383006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2146390/extras/24c371eb60d6ba2cc7b2567b3fab2128.webm?t=1753383006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
